flowchart TD
    accTitle: The feature discovery loop
    accDescr {
        Blue nodes are human steps: first record a do-nothing control clip, then
        record an action clip with the same setup and a single changed input, review the replay,
        and decide whether it looks correct.
        Green rectangular nodes are Astra's steps: compare the binary, decode it,
        and add the result to the digital twin.
        No sends corrections back to Astra. Yes starts the next experiment.
    }

    control["Record control clip"]
    action["Record action clip"]
    probe["Compare the binary"]
    decode["Decode"]
    twin["Add to digital twin"]
    check["Review the replay"]
    good{"Looks correct?"}

    control --> action
    action --> probe
    probe --> decode
    decode --> twin
    twin --> check
    check --> good
    good -->|No: Corrections| probe
    good -->|Yes: Next experiment| control

    classDef human fill:#e5eaff,stroke:#2047d6,color:#171813,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ai fill:#e2f2ed,stroke:#267367,color:#171813,stroke-width:2px
    class control,action,check,good human
    class probe,decode,twin ai
